{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a765c678b54cc0aa","type":"text","text":"- [ ] Add scenes at the gym, like with Don. Maybe like him giving Sara tips. Days where Sara shows up pissed and just wants to punch really hard. ","x":-1000,"y":-1460,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"5468a214a5240c08","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/2.01-Move In.md","x":-1800,"y":-1460,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"320b2f99d3b119e9","type":"text","text":"Maybe Jane makes pancakes and offers to share, but Sara's like no thanks, way too many carbs not enough protein. But thanks for the offer. And makes something with eggs. \n\nOr just like thanks for the offer, but I really got to get some protein in me. ","x":-1680,"y":-940,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"d6cceee3c19b897b","type":"text","text":"# Can I hang a painting here? \n\nI have the part where Jane asked to hang a painting on the wall, and either like have this happen multiple times or like establish in the scene that like this was the fifth time this week Jane had asked if she could hang a painting in a particular spot, so Sarah was just like look you can hang any painting you want anywhere you want in the entire house I'm fine with it it's fine I know we're sharing the house, but like you can put paintings anywhere I'm good with any painting in any spot it's fine. ","x":-1140,"y":-700,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"944aee1e5d023f0d","type":"text","text":"# Meeting Over Coffee\n\nJane and Sara connect via a website for matching roommates. Sara though Jane was cute in her picture, Jane thought Sara looked interesting. \n\nThen in person, Sara thinks Jane is even cuter, but doesn't really comment on it. I mean Sara might say a little something but something like your earrings are cute and look nice or something like that. Jane says she likes one of Sarah's tattoos, and I don't know exactly what they say but generally I want this to be like an easy conversation with they both feel comfortable, and so they decide to be roommates. \n\nMaybe Jane gets excited over something? And so Sara gets to see her be all excited. \n\nMaybe when Jane compliments Sarah's tattoos or like one of the tattoos Sarah isn't sure what to say cuz she's not used to getting complimented about them. They can also discuss things like so were you thinking in an apartment or a house unless that was already basically pre-selected by the site? Talk about usual routines I guess? \n\nMaybe the website encourages being honest about deal breakers, so Sarah can be like well I'm going to want my exercise equipment somewhere in the house and you know I will definitely want to go for a house and my apartment, and James like I want a house I went somewhere to put my easel and I'd like to hang at least some artwork on the wall at least a few pink things. It totally turns into more but you know whatever. ","x":-816,"y":-3280,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"9f631c083d918d2d","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/2.04-To date, or Not to date.md","x":-460,"y":-959,"width":590,"height":640},
		{"id":"fdc87e42a425604d","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/2.03-Art Galleries.md","x":-365,"y":-1460,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"58312901eab3ff21","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/2.05-To Know.md","x":520,"y":-1001,"width":480,"height":560},
		{"id":"e6b6718f6cb065d2","type":"text","text":"At first, Jane wanted to use a birth control option. So, they used a barrier method for a while. Because Sara had already experimented with hormonal birth control in the past, but instead of the performance stabilization many other female athletes saw, it caused major issues for her. Including interfering with weight management, making it impossible at times for her to choose what weight class she completed in. \n\nThankfully, Jane had been so understanding about that part. \"It's fine, not everyone can do hormonal birth control. It's your body, it's up to you.\" She'd said. \n\nSara had smiled, happy to have Jane in her corner. It was something she grew to really enjoy about their relationship: how much Jane loved her just as she was. Not that Sara would want Jane to change, but it made Sara happy that the feeling was mutual. It was so common that people expected Sara to be something other than what she was, it was part of why she had acted out some much as a teen. Sara had made peace with how she didn't fit society's norms, but it was still refreshing to have someone in her life who loved her exactly how she was. \n\nThough once they were married, Sara really didn't see the point. One time, that barrier method was giving them trouble, and Sara couldn't help but point out, \"You know, that really isn't necessary. I'm fine if we don't use it.\" \n\nJane looked at her, \"Really? You sure?\" \n\nUnfortunately Sara was sure it redundant, \"Yeah,\" it wasn't like she would get pregnant either way. The thought made kind of sad and hurt. To cover those feelings, she pulled Jane close and whispered in her ear, \"I'm sure I want to touch you.\" When Jane moaned in response, Sara kissed her neck. ","x":572,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"e26c26cd25ef8ca2","type":"text","text":"- [ ] add Sara's job, at least that she has one. ","x":1160,"y":-801,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"39aaff0567ae8fd8","type":"text","text":"# Moving in together ","x":760,"y":-3280,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"9205f9acd748ac76","type":"text","text":"# House Hunt & Tour\n\nOnce they've decided to actually be roommates, well they start looking at places. And probably only show them actually viewing the daisy hovel house. They noticed that it has one bedroom with one big bed. Maybe Jane blushes, but Sara is like I can sleep on a cot, I've slept on worse. We can save up some money and build a second bedroom. (The irony being that when they have money for a second bedroom it's for their twin daughters). And they're thinking about saving up to get separate beds, but they end up falling for each other before that happens. \n\nMaybe Jane likes the big porch for her painting easel while Sarah likes the living room cuz she can make it sort of a living/workout room. Like they think the house is cute, and I start talking about where to put furniture and so they like it and they end up going at that house. ","x":-80,"y":-3280,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"fc370d2cb007dbd5","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/1.50-Meeting Over Coffee.md","x":-816,"y":-3680,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"e080f4c8f5eeeca7","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/1.60-House Hunting.md","x":-80,"y":-3680,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"d60b53fd9ab1dcee","x":760,"y":-3680,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/2.01-Move In.md"}
